                 I realized that 95% of the work was already done, only some
                 things in the filereq. were left to do ... ;-)

v1.0  Feb'1996 - the last procedures and GTBuild.mco have been programmed,
                 the DBF-file completed and the documentations written (uh ;) )

               - Other programmes are planed and realized

      01.03.96 - Finally GTLib will be released in the public



